title: Union Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: ugt_fundraising_timer <= 0
on-arrival: ugt_fundraising_timer = 9; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/organitzeu.jpg
tags: ugt_affairs

=  Union Fundraising

As a worker's union, the UGT relies on member dues to fund long strikes (*cajas de resistencia*), legal defense for its members and different organizations for the working class.

The party and union's treasury are nominally separated; however, funds can be shifted between them when necessary.

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.
- @fund_party: Transfer union funds to the PSOE party treasury.
- @fund_ugt: Siphon PSOE party funds into the UGT treasury.

@maintain
subtitle: [+ ugt_dues +] resources gained.
on-arrival: ugt_resources += ugt_dues;

We maintain our current dues.

@reduce
subtitle: [+ ugt_dues - 1 +] resources gained.
choose-if: ugt_dues > 1
on-arrival: ugt_dues -= 1; ugt_resources += ugt_dues; js_strength += 20; rural_psoe += 5;

Our current members appreciate this. Lowering dues makes union membership accesible to more landless peasants, some of them join our Juventudes Socialistas.

@increase
subtitle: [+ ugt_dues + 1 +] resources gained. [? if unemployed >= 15 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if ugt_dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: ugt_dues += 1; ugt_resources += ugt_dues; workers_psoe -= 2; unemployed_psoe -= 2; rural_psoe -= 4; workers_psoe -= 10 if unemployed >= 20; unemployed_psoe -= 10 if unemployed >= 20; workers_psoe -= 3*dues if dues >= 5; unemployed_psoe -= 3*dues if dues >= 5; js_strength -= 20; 
view-if: ugt_dues <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources. 

[? if unemployed >= 20 : Because of the presently high unemployment, our members are feeling the extra burden hard. ?]

@fund_party
subtitle: -1 UGT Resource, +1 Party Resource
choose-if: ugt_resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The UGT treasury does not have spare resources.
on-arrival: ugt_resources -= 1; resources += 1; prietistas_dissent -= 2;

We transfer union funds to support the political campaigns and press organs of the PSOE.

@fund_ugt
subtitle: -1 Party Resource, +1 UGT Resource
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The PSOE party treasury is empty.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; ugt_resources += 1;

We redirect party funds into the UGT to strengthen labor mobilization and strike funds.
